  "_secrets": [
    "Every value left empty below is a SECRET and must come from the environment, never",
    "from this file. This file ships inside deploy\\api, so anything written here is",
    "published to the server and lives in source control forever.",
    "",
    "Set these as environment variables (see deploy\\DEPLOY.md for how, on IIS):",
    "  Smtp__Password          JwtSettings__Key",
    "  GitHub__ClientId        GitHub__ClientSecret",
    "  Google__ClientId        Google__ClientSecret",
    "  Microsoft__ClientId     Microsoft__ClientSecret",
    "  Turn__SharedSecret      (only needed once in-app meeting calling is enabled)",
    "",
    "The double underscore is the .NET convention for a nested key: Smtp__Password",
    "binds to Smtp:Password. The app refuses to start without the first four."
